// Pardus b43 firmware installers download + verify firmware inside their
// postinst, which breaks under live-build chroot (dpkg error -> build abort).
// Debian's builds of the same packages configure cleanly, so forbid the
// Pardus builds and fall back to Debian's. (1.1.6 pardus CI fix)
Explanation: Pardus b43 postinst fails in chroot, use Debian builds
Package: firmware-b43-installer firmware-b43legacy-installer
Pin: release o=Pardus
Pin-Priority: -1
